{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:74546ea469cc6d78e0a11f0876ba93efed024cb0714c12b98a9e30c0c4c7d4bd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2e0cbf566a18c45d4ce4e94f7b11130758ebb350a84dff5a39664cbf6a994a6",
      "text": "想起让人怀念的事情了。\n我第一次写歌时的对话，你还记得吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82e7ed294e8a8a5e1fc79b3721a813975207a5bc553a0eeda7d7f6557c4001c",
      "text": "嗯？……啊，是重新确认了\n天峰秀是个天才的那天的事情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7213d3a738fdd120945eb4b4e8810dac249fb9488174dc5d9a16c8bbd71ea247",
      "text": "毕竟是让你久违地露出笑容的一天嘛。\n怎么可能忘得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d62079561a4e66024e9ab8e70559351d5a077d03ee1e9880dd1c0218efe1e7e",
      "text": "我笑了吗？\n……不，怎么可能啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3f6a7e2d1ea11864242e8ca8e795c78bc69256ca7c50711b2ed2a9723db5f87",
      "text": "搞什么嘛，你没好好记着吗？\n不过，那个时候，多少打发了你的无聊吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ccfe5680fae149a62f79a2e8976c251c44684d31dd6807850b2d25b4880b8c",
      "text": "看好吧。无论是我们无聊的人生，还是这个世界。\n总有一天我要用我的音乐，把它们变成有趣的东西！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f90c938df903b50648c80212c3228f4660cb08bfca8c64bb0d2640657a4ae617",
      "text": "……是啊。\n要是你的话，说不定真的能做到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e038446c65e72e44ba8670808fd1891313debd8e5e2f54a85d97c00e1304a6f0",
      "text": "不是说不定，是一定能做到啦。\n我的才能，你不是最清楚了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:845a61696602c27681c65a470b07eeb1c1113d5bd4d8b0fa616f791aa4d47b13",
      "text": "哈哈，确实是呢。失礼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53889f78e15b3b85d66953861874344c669413b1214b8d9d017601a923b07dcc",
      "text": "你可别当成事不关己啊。\n你也要和我一起，去改变这个世界哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af6e5c1bffb639b62488f1fdab1e018667975468a32df444f67cf81b70a0bdba",
      "text": "啊啊，那听起来挺有意思的。\n这样暂时就不会觉得无聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
